  message: "OWNER RULING 2026-11-20 (in session): a README that an instruction file imports (e.g. CLAUDE.md '@README.md') still gives the sketch its short README description, under QUOTED_TEXT_NOTICE; its whole-file content is still never printed (Additional Files / Source Files Content). Reason: a README is written for people, and the description is the sketch's one-line project summary. Follow-up to PR 4 commit dd161cf12, which held the description back."  # feb6
